		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour tout le monde,<br />jai un master qui fonctionne correctement mais le slave ne fonctionne pas. J ai essaye de reparer le slave avec: pg_basebackup -h Adresse - IP -D /db_data/TDSBR01 -U replicator -P -V -R- X stream -p 27500</p><p>pg_basebackup: initiating base backup, waiting for checkpoint to complete<br />pg_basebackup: checkpoint completed<br />pg_basebackup: write-ahead log start point: 7FA/58000028 on timeline 3<br />pg_basebackup: error: could not get backup header: ERROR:&#160; could not open directory &quot;./UPDATE&quot;: Permission denied (11587)<br /> (15582)<br />pg_basebackup: removing data directory &quot;/db_data/TDSBRO1D&quot;<br />[fep@t-orc-brs-006 db_data]$ timed out waiting for input: auto-logout<br />[root@t-orc-brs-006 ~]# timed out waiting for input: auto-logout</p><p>Jai change l appartenance de ./UPDATE mais rien n est fait. J arrive pas a corriger le probleme.</p>]]></content>
